ve  arguing it will put u.s and afghan lives  at risk  it undermines our commitment to the  afghan people  particularly afghan women senator jeanne  shaheen said  in a statement adding the biden  administration must make  every effort between now and september  to protect  the progress made the united states  intends to keep a diplomatic presence  in afghanistan what is less clear is  just how many clandestine forces  and u.s security contractors will remain  to monitor and meet  future threats kimberly helkit al  jazeera the white house
 

